{"id": "new_premium.carousel_items_5_text", "category": "new_premium", "en": "AI is shaping the future, and those who can harness its power will unlock endless opportunities. This learning experience starts with CodeCombat Junior and CodeCombat. It expands into AI HackStack, where learners will master the art of crafting effective AI prompts and using the latest generative AI tools in a safe and secure environment. ", "zh_CN": "人工智能正在塑造未来，能够驾驭其力量的人将解锁无限的机遇。这种学习体验从CodeCombat Junior和CodeCombat开始，扩展到扣哒宇宙，学习者将在安全可靠的环境中掌握制作有效人工智能提示和使用最新生成式人工智能工具的艺术。", "group_id": "e6210cf95c52f587"}
