{"id": "new_premium.carousel_items_3_text", "category": "new_premium", "en": "Web development is constantly evolving, and staying ahead of the curve is essential. In this curriculum, foundational web development activities will be conducted in CodeCombat, while CodeCombat Junior provides an accessible starting point for younger learners. AI HackStack will serve as the primary platform for building and publishing projects, with limited use of CodeCombat Worlds and AI League to reinforce key coding concepts in an engaging way.", "zh_CN": "Web开发不断发展，保持领先地位至关重要。在本课程中，基础Web开发活动将在CodeCombat中进行，而CodeCombat Junior则为年轻的学习者提供了一个易于入门的起点。扣哒宇宙将作为构建和发布项目的主要平台，少量使用CodeCombat Worlds和AI League以引人入胜的方式加强关键的编码概念。", "group_id": "ec194ee582d6de42"}
