{"id": "ozaria_home.core_curriculum_carousel_item4_p", "category": "ozaria_home", "en": "Next, your students will put what they learned into practice by typing real Python or JavaScript to solve a variety of challenges in scaffolded game levels. Built-in hints help students identify and fix bugs, leading to greater coding confidence.", "zh_CN": "下一步，学生将进入写代码阶段，通过Python, JavaScript和C++等程序语言真实代码训练，完成不同难度的关卡学习挑战，学生在闯关的过程中，可以通过关卡提示发现和修复程序中的bug，满满的成就感油然而生！", "group_id": "ebec1bba76a6f467"}
