{"id": "hackstack_page.faq_1_answer", "category": "hackstack_page", "en": "AI HackStack is great for middle school and high school-aged students. Our safety and privacy practices allow us to help younger users, like your students, interface safely with AI.  Do you teach elementary-aged students? If so, **[mailto:team@codecombat.com]connect with our team** to learn more about CodeCombat AI Junior, which introduces multimodal generative AI in a simple and intuitive platform designed specifically for K-5 students.\"", "zh_CN": "扣哒宇宙非常适合初中和高中阶段的学生。我们的安全与隐私实践让年轻用户（如您的学生）能够安全地与 AI 互动。如果您教授的是小学生，请**[mailto:team@codecombat.com]联系我们的团队**，了解更多关于 CodeCombat AI Junior 的信息，这是一个专为 K-5 学生设计的简单直观的多模态生成式 AI 平台。", "group_id": "bebace1d6986484e"}
{"id": "school_administrator.membership_tooltip", "category": "school_administrator", "en": "<p><b>The Classroom Membership History</b> displays the total number of unique students who were enrolled across all classrooms.</p><p><b>Remember:</b> Classes may be archived and licenses may be reused throughout the school year, so these numbers represent how many students truly participated in the program.</p>", "zh_CN": "<p><b>班级成员历史：</b>显示所有班级中注册过的学生总人数（去重后）。</p><p><b>注意：</b>班级可能会被归档，授权许可在学年期间可能会被重复使用，所以这些数字反映的是实际参与该项目的学生数量。</p>", "group_id": "3e5638a5154d7a6f"}
